    "Details": "Developed by Clan Goliath Scorpion, the Phoenix Hawk PHX-1-EC was an upgrade of the earlier PHX-1. Designed at the start of the Golden Age, the PHX-1-EC is built around a 270-rated Fusion Core and is armed with an Improved Large Laser. A pair of prototype ER Medium Lasers and an AMS make up the rest of the PHX-1-EC’s weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
